  "html": "<div style=\"max-width: 1050px; margin: 0 auto; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #171717; line-height: 1.5;\">\n<div style=\"padding: 38px 0 30px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #E7E7E7; margin-bottom: 38px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #777777; margin-bottom: 10px;\">VCDS401 \u00b7 AUTUMN 2026</div>\n<h1 style=\"font-size: 40px; line-height: 1.08; margin: 0 0 8px 0;\">Introduction to Communication Design</h1>\n<div style=\"font-size: 21px; color: #666666;\">(A) \u00b7 Principles and Inspirations</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 48px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #777777; margin-bottom: 7px;\">MODULE INTRODUCTION</div>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 27px; margin: 0 0 18px 0;\">Welcome</h2>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 27px; margin: 0 0 18px 0;\"><span style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 12px;\"><iframe class=\"lti-embed\" style=\"width: 616px; height: 357px; display: inline-block;\" title=\"PC intro video\" src=\"https://buv.instructure.com/courses/7301/external_tools/retrieve?display=borderless&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fbuv.instructuremedia.com%2Flti%2Flaunch%3Fcustom_arc_launch_type%3Dthumbnail_embed%26custom_arc_media_id%3D132ea35e-6785-4caa-aa94-cc8fcc46abf0-34896%26custom_arc_show_rolling_transcript%3Dtrue%26custom_arc_start_at%3D0\" width=\"480\" height=\"278\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" webkitallowfullscreen=\"webkitallowfullscreen\" mozallowfullscreen=\"mozallowfullscreen\" allow=\"geolocation *; microphone *; camera *; midi *; encrypted-media *; autoplay *; clipboard-write *; display-capture *; fullscreen *\" data-titletext=\"PC intro video\" data-studio-resizable=\"true\" data-studio-tray-enabled=\"true\" data-studio-convertible-to-link=\"true\" loading=\"lazy\"></iframe></span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 27px; margin: 0 0 18px 0;\"><span style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 12px;\">LEARNING OUTCOMES</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 27px; margin: 0 0 18px 0;\">What will you learn?</h2>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 50px;\">\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 22px 0; font-size: 14px; color: #666666;\">By the end of this module, you should be able to:</p>\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 14px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<div style=\"flex: 1; background: #F3F0F8; padding: 22px; border-radius: 10px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 11px; color: #776895; margin-bottom: 8px;\">LO1</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 17px; margin-bottom: 6px;\">Understand Design</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #555555;\">Analyse visual communication and design concepts within different contexts.</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1; background: #EEF5FA; padding: 22px; border-radius: 10px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 11px; color: #57778c; margin-bottom: 8px;\">LO2</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 17px; margin-bottom: 6px;\">Communicate Visually</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #555555;\">Use typography, imagery and visual language to communicate ideas effectively.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 14px;\">\n<div style=\"flex: 1; background: #FAF2E9; padding: 22px; border-radius: 10px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 11px; color: #9a7450; margin-bottom: 8px;\">LO3</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 17px; margin-bottom: 6px;\">Develop Your Process</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #555555;\">Explore, experiment and document your design development in your Process Workbook.</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1; background: #EEF6F1; padding: 22px; border-radius: 10px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 11px; color: #5e7d69; margin-bottom: 8px;\">LO4</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 17px; margin-bottom: 6px;\">Reflect + Improve</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #555555;\">Reflect on your work, respond to feedback and improve your design decisions.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 45px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #777777; margin-bottom: 7px;\">WEEKLY TIMETABLE</div>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 27px; margin: 0 0 6px 0;\">Your Week</h2>\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 20px 0; font-size: 14px; color: #666666;\">Seminar + practical workshop schedule</p>\n<div style=\"overflow-x: auto; border-radius: 12px; background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e1e4e8;\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%; min-width: 850px; border-collapse: collapse; table-layout: fixed; font-size: 12px;\">\n<thead>\n<tr style=\"background: #F7F8FA;\">\n<th style=\"width: 65px; padding: 13px 7px; border-right: 1px solid #E5E7EB; border-bottom: 1px solid #E5E7EB;\"></th>\n<th style=\"padding: 13px 8px; border-right: 1px solid #E5E7EB; border-bottom: 1px solid #E5E7EB; color: #555555;\">MON</th>\n<th style=\"padding: 13px 8px; border-right: 1px solid #E5E7EB; border-bottom: 1px solid #E5E7EB; color: #555555;\">TUE</th>\n<th style=\"padding: 13px 8px; border-right: 1px solid #E5E7EB; border-bottom: 1px solid #E5E7EB; color: #555555;\">WED</th>\n<th style=\"padding: 13px 8px; border-right: 1px solid #E5E7EB; border-bottom: 1px solid #E5E7EB; color: #555555;\">THU</th>\n<th style=\"padding: 13px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #E5E7EB; color: #555555;\">FRI</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 50px;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 7px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: right; color: #999999; border-right: 1px solid #E5E7EB; border-bottom: 1px solid #EEEEEE;\">9 AM</td>\n<td style=\"border-right: 1px solid #EEEEEE; border-bottom: 1px solid #EEEEEE;\"></td>\n<td style=\"border-right: 1px solid #EEEEEE; border-bottom: 1px solid #EEEEEE;\"></td>\n<td style=\"border-right: 1px solid #EEEEEE; border-bottom: 1px solid #EEEEEE;\"></td>\n<td style=\"border-right: 1px solid #EEEEEE; border-bottom: 1px solid #EEEEEE;\"></td>\n<td style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #EEEEEE;\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 50px;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 7px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: right; color: #999999; border-right: 1px solid #E5E7EB; border-bottom: 1px solid #EEEEEE;\">10 AM</td>\n<td style=\"border-right: 1px solid #EEEEEE; border-bottom: 1px solid #EEEEEE;\"></td>\n<td style=\"border-right: 1px solid #EEEEEE; border-bottom: 1px solid #EEEEEE;\"></td>\n<td style=\"border-right: 1px solid #EEEEEE; border-bottom: 1px solid #EEEEEE;\"></td>\n<td style=\"border-right: 1px solid #EEEEEE; border-bottom: 1px solid #EEEEEE;\"></td>\n<td style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #EEEEEE;\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 50px;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 7px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: right; color: #999999; border-right: 1px solid #E5E7EB; border-bottom: 1px solid #EEEEEE;\">11 AM</td>\n<td style=\"border-right: 1px solid #EEEEEE; border-bottom: 1px solid #EEEEEE;\"></td>\n<td style=\"border-right: 1px solid #EEEEEE; border-bottom: 1px solid #EEEEEE;\"></td>\n<td style=\"border-right: 1px solid #EEEEEE; border-bottom: 1px solid #EEEEEE;\"></td>\n<td style=\"border-right: 1px solid #EEEEEE; border-bottom: 1px solid #EEEEEE;\"></td>\n<td style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #EEEEEE;\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 50px;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 7px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: right; color: #999999; border-right: 1px solid #E5E7EB; border-bottom: 1px solid #EEEEEE;\">12 PM</td>\n<td style=\"border-right: 1px solid #EEEEEE; border-bottom: 1px solid #EEEEEE;\"></td>\n<td style=\"border-right: 1px solid #EEEEEE; border-bottom: 1px solid #EEEEEE;\"></td>\n<td style=\"border-right: 1px solid #EEEEEE; border-bottom: 1px solid #EEEEEE;\"></td>\n<td style=\"border-right: 1px solid #EEEEEE; border-bottom: 1px solid #EEEEEE;\"></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; vertical-align: top; border-bottom: 1px solid #EEEEEE;\" rowspan=\"2\">\n<div style=\"height: 90px; background: #FFF0E6; border-left: 4px solid #C9855C; border-radius: 6px; padding: 9px 10px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Workshop</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 11px; margin-top: 1px;\">Set 001</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 10px; color: #666666; margin-top: 6px;\">12:00\u20132:00 PM</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 10px; color: #666666;\">E.3-9</div>\n<div style=