tyle=\"border-right: 1px solid #EEEEEE; border-bottom: 1px solid #EEEEEE;\"></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 5px; vertical-align: top; border-right: 1px solid #EEEEEE; border-bottom: 1px solid #EEEEEE;\" rowspan=\"2\">\n<div style=\"height: 90px; background: #EAF5EF; border-left: 4px solid #628773; border-radius: 6px; padding: 9px 10px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Workshop</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 11px; margin-top: 1px;\">Set 002</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 10px; color: #666666; margin-top: 6px;\">3:00\u20135:00 PM</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 10px; color: #666666;\">B.3-5</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 10px; color: #888888;\">Belfast Castle</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #EEEEEE;\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 50px;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 7px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: right; color: #999999; border-right: 1px solid #E5E7EB;\">4 PM</td>\n<td style=\"border-right: 1px solid #EEEEEE;\"></td>\n<td style=\"border-right: 1px solid #EEEEEE;\"></td>\n<td style=\"border-right: 1px solid #EEEEEE;\"></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 20px; margin-top: 13px; font-size: 11px; color: #666666;\">\n<div><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 9px; height: 9px; background: #826FA2; border-radius: 2px; margin-right: 5px;\"> </span> Seminar</div>\n<div><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 9px; height: 9px; background: #628773; border-radius: 2px; margin-right: 5px;\"> </span> Workshop \u00b7 Set 002</div>\n<div><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 9px; height: 9px; background: #C9855C; border-radius: 2px; margin-right: 5px;\"> </span> Workshop \u00b7 Set 001</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border-top: 1px solid #E7E7E7; padding: 20px 0 35px 0; font-size: 13px; color: #777777;\">Please check your assigned workshop set and refer to Canvas regularly for weekly learning materials and updates.</div>\n</div>"
